{"title": "Treasure Table", "pageid": 51950, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Treasure_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Treasure Tables</b> define for all inventories in the game, what is and what has a chance to appear in those inventories.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>For all places an occasions where items can be aquired in-game, Treasure Tables are used to define which items can be obtained. These places and occasions include chests, trade inventories, characters to be pickpocketed, corpses to be looted, scenery as for example in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a> where the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phalar_Aluve\" title=\"Phalar Aluve\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Longsword_%2B1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phalar_Aluve\" title=\"Phalar Aluve\">Phalar Aluve</a> is found, and even rewards as for example when saving <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Florrick\" title=\"Florrick\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png/25px-Portrait_Florrick.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png/38px-Portrait_Florrick.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png/50px-Portrait_Florrick.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Florrick\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png/25px-Portrait_Florrick.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Portrait_Florrick.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Florrick\" title=\"Florrick\">Florrick</a> from the fire in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Waukeen%27s_Rest\" title=\"Waukeen's Rest\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Waukeen's Rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Waukeen%27s_Rest\" title=\"Waukeen's Rest\">Waukeen's Rest</a>.\n</p><p>By using these tables the items in them are not necessarily defined as appearing or not, but can also be defined as having a chance to appear or not.\n</p><p>Treasure Tables also can be defined in hierarchies, which means that a Treasure Table can use one or more other Treasure Tables as subtables. These are Treasure Tables that are intended to be referenced by other Treasure Tables. They are prefixed with \"ST_\" in the game files. \n</p><p>For more technical details on how Treasure Tables work under the hood, see the modding page <a href=\"/wiki/Modding:Treasure_Tables\" title=\"Modding:Treasure Tables\">Modding:Treasure Tables</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>This concept is commonly referred to as <b>Drop Tables</b>, but strictly speaking that term would be too limiting, since drops typically refer to items looted from corpses (<i>dropped off the unit</i>) and these tables encompass chests and traders as well.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Drop_tables\" title=\"Category:Drop tables\">List of all Treasure Tables</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195532\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 806/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5171/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1013/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643386/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   22.019      1 -total\n 70.32%   15.484      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 39.74%    8.750      1 Template:Item_icon\n 20.89%    4.599      1 Template:CharLink\n 20.54%    4.522      2 Template:Icon_link\n 18.16%    3.998      2 Template:Icon_text\n 17.49%    3.851     10 Template:Trim\n 14.55%    3.203      4 Template:Ifempty\n 11.29%    2.485      2 Template:ItemIcon_Internal\n  9.63%    2.121      4 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:51950-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195532 and revision id 369357. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}